Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.24,0:01:00.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,呀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.55,0:03:20.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,发 发生什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.09,0:03:22.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这么大动静
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:23.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是何人飞升啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.42,0:03:25.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是哪位新贵飞升了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:26.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好大的阵仗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.59,0:03:28.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,平时有人飞升 最多也就震两下\N我的神宫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.01,0:03:29.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,平时有人飞升 最多也就震两下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.35,0:03:30.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但今天这架势
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.85,0:03:32.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天都快震塌了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.27,0:03:34.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想必这飞升之人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.35,0:03:35.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,定是天赋异禀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.52,0:03:36.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,修为绝佳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:37.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,吉人天相
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:38.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,运势惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.56,0:03:40.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,了不得 了不得呀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.69,0:03:41.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,究竟是何方神圣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.82,0:03:42.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,几百年前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.57,0:03:44.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那仙乐太子飞升也是这般
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.86,0:03:46.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,呸呸呸 提他做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.45,0:03:46.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,晦气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:49.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走走走
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:50.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,去看看到底是何方神圣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.83,0:03:52.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.39,0:04:07.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还有完没完
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.84,0:04:08.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么又是他\N还有完没完
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.34,0:04:09.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么又是他
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.53,0:04:27.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下 恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.95,0:04:29.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一飞升就摘得本甲子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.95,0:04:33.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,最盼望将其贬下凡间的神官榜 第一名
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.45,0:04:36.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,虽然是个第一
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.83,0:04:38.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但好像也没什么可喜的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.42,0:04:39.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,本榜第一
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.63,0:04:40.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可得一百功德
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:43.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,下次评选也请捎上我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.84,0:04:45.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那你知道第二名是谁吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:46.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太难猜了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:47.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,论实力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:49.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我一人应可包揽前三甲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:50.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,差不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.93,0:04:51.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没有第二名
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:53.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你一骑绝尘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:54.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,望尘莫及
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:57.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那上一甲子的榜首是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.10,0:04:59.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:01.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,因为这个榜是从今年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.56,0:05:02.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,准确来说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.77,0:05:04.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是从今天才开设的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.78,0:05:05.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.57,0:05:06.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看来我运气不错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.78,0:05:07.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,恰好赶上了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.86,0:05:12.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你知道自己为什么会夺魁吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.41,0:05:13.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,众望所归
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.37,0:05:15.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下 请看那个钟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.91,0:05:18.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哪里有钟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:20.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没看到就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.25,0:05:22.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那里本来有钟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:25.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但你飞升的时候把它震掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.17,0:05:26.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还砸了一位路过的神官
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.51,0:05:29.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那现在如何了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:31.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还在修
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:33.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我是说那位神官
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.18,0:05:34.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,被砸的是位武神
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.97,0:05:36.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,反手就把钟劈了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:39.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再看那边的金殿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.48,0:05:43.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这次看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.06,0:05:44.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看到才不对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.15,0:05:46.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那里本来什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.65,0:05:49.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你飞升的时候震毁了数座金殿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:50.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,来不及修
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:53.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只能临时搭几座凑合了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.66,0:05:54.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,责任在我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.12,0:05:55.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.79,0:05:56.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,责任在你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.95,0:06:00.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我是不是刚上来就把很多神官得罪了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:02.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也不是不能挽回
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.63,0:06:03.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么挽回
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.63,0:06:06.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好说 八百八十八万功德
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.51,0:06:11.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我知道 十分之一你都拿不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:12.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是万分之一
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.18,0:06:13.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也拿不出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.97,0:06:15.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,莫慌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.01,0:06:17.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,车到山前必有路
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.18,0:06:20.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我是船到桥头自然沉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:21.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我有一计
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.14,0:06:24.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,进通灵阵的口令没忘吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:26.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.99,0:06:33.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有完没完
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.03,0:06:36.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,开盘下注买定离手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:38.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诸位 都到齐了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.41,0:06:40.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君北方有要务
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.21,0:06:42.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,急需用人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:46.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知哪位武神殿下\N能从殿里拨两名武官过来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.26,0:06:51.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,听说帝君现下不在北方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:54.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,灵文殿 怕是替谁借人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.68,0:06:55.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.76,0:06:57.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要快速获取功德
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.35,0:06:58.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是没有办法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.89,0:07:04.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,近来北方有一批大信徒频频请愿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:07.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,求天官下凡以平妖鬼之祟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.94,0:07:11.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,目下帝君顾不上北方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.07,0:07:13.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明光将军也有事在身
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.53,0:07:16.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若殿下能代为去一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.24,0:07:18.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,则届时所获功德
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.45,0:07:21.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,将尽数奉于你坛上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.83,0:07:24.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这不是太子殿下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.25,0:07:26.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这都多少回了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:26.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没完没了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.83,0:07:27.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他怎么又飞升了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:29.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下这是又回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.17,0:07:29.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,多少次了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:30.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,第三次了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.67,0:07:31.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.17,0:07:32.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我赌他这次撑不了一年
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:33.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一年太长了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.55,0:07:34.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,上次他一炷香的时间就下去了\N一年太长了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.59,0:07:35.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,上次他一炷香的时间就下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.55,0:07:36.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我赌三天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.22,0:07:42.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,刚才灵文殿说帝君要借人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.06,0:07:44.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,莫不是给太子殿下借的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.77,0:07:45.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,肯定是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.94,0:07:47.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,现在最缺人的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:48.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是他谢怜了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.27,0:07:48.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,无香火 无宫观 无信徒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:49.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三无神官\N无香火 无宫观 无信徒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.98,0:07:50.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三界笑柄\N无香火 无宫观 无信徒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:51.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三界笑柄
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.69,0:07:55.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你看 我说借不来人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:07:59.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家好 我又回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.28,0:08:01.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下这次飞升
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:03.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真是好大的阵仗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:05.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.12,0:08:07.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下是好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.67,0:08:08.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我就不太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.17,0:08:10.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下 那个钟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:14.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,钟的事我听说了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.67,0:08:16.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,砸到你真是万分抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.72,0:08:17.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.59,0:08:19.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,请问 阁下怎么称呼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.64,0:08:23.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这都忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.02,0:08:27.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下 那是玄真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.19,0:08:28.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,玄 玄真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:29.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他是慕情
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.86,0:08:33.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是谁拆了我的金殿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.11,0:08:37.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,滚出来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.53,0:08:39.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你拆的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.82,0:08:40.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.24,0:08:41.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,给我等着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.16,0:08:42.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,拆你金殿的人就在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.20,0:08:44.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,自己问呗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.29,0:08:49.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:50.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对不起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.79,0:08:52.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:53.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那是南阳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:54.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:56.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可他好像没认出我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:08:58.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.22,0:08:59.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他只是多在凡间
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.76,0:09:01.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知你又飞升了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.64,0:09:03.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诸位 非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.76,0:09:06.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所有损失我会尽数奉还
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:07.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还望给我一点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:08.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.64,0:09:11.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下 最好是说话算话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.23,0:09:13.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我还有公务在身
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.82,0:09:16.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没其他事的话就先告辞了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:17.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我还有事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.95,0:09:18.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我先撤了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.24,0:09:18.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,溜了溜了\N我先撤了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:18.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也走了\N溜了溜了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.70,0:09:19.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也走了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.03,0:09:19.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.08,0:09:26.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.29,0:09:28.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要是玄真没说话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.91,0:09:30.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,本可以借到人的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.38,0:09:33.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没事 我一个人习惯了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:34.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那你需要法宝吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.30,0:09:35.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也不用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.55,0:09:38.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我被贬两次 法力尽失
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.80,0:09:40.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,到了凡间便用不了法宝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.97,0:09:41.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.76,0:09:43.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,此事关系重大
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.47,0:09:46.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还请殿下务必谨慎行事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.14,0:09:49.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若遇难处 可随时联系
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.19,0:09:52.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,灵文殿会尽全力支持
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.98,0:09:55.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,任务详情在此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:09:57.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:09:59.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可还有疑问
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.61,0:10:02.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,灵文 这次谢谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.87,0:10:06.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我只负责办事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.95,0:10:09.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要谢便等帝君回来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.71,0:10:10.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你亲自谢他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:11.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:20.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那便预祝殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.63,0:10:22.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,此去一帆风顺
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.18,0:10:24.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天官赐福
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:29.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,百无禁忌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.70,0:10:45.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,听说了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.41,0:10:46.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,与君山上又出事了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.62,0:10:47.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:48.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又失踪一个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:48.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可不是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:51.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么时候是个头啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:53.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又一个姑娘遭殃了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.93,0:11:04.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,客官里边请
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.59,0:11:06.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,您请坐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.06,0:11:14.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一壶茶 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.73,0:11:15.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.11,0:11:16.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,请问
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.11,0:11:18.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,近来附近可有什么怪事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:19.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.11,0:11:22.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,非礼勿言 非礼勿言
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.59,0:11:41.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.55,0:11:43.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.63,0:11:45.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,灵文
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.43,0:11:46.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下 好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:49.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,中天庭有两位小神官
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.76,0:11:51.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,愿来助你一臂之力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.85,0:11:53.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这会儿人应该到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.10,0:11:55.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小神官
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.48,0:12:01.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,灵文啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.65,0:12:03.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他们不像来助我行事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.49,0:12:04.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,更像来取我狗头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.11,0:12:06.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你莫不是把人家诳了过来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.49,0:12:09.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,灵文 灵文
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.13,0:12:24.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,请问 二位是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.09,0:12:24.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南风
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.17,0:12:25.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,扶摇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.84,0:12:27.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是问你们名字啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.63,0:12:29.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,多谢二位肯来相助
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.68,0:12:31.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,敢问二位来自哪位殿下座下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.01,0:12:32.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南阳殿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.97,0:12:33.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,玄真殿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.69,0:12:39.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所 所以是你们家将军派你们来的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.44,0:12:41.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我家将军不知此事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.78,0:12:44.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我家将军也不知
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.78,0:12:48.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那你们 知道我是谁吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:50.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:53.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是人间正道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:54.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是世界中心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.41,0:12:56.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他是不是翻了个白眼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.66,0:12:58.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是 让他滚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.33,0:13:00.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,凭什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:01.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要滚你滚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.88,0:13:06.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等一下 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.17,0:13:08.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们真是自愿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:09.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,此事不必勉强
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.43,0:13:13.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我 自 愿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.14,0:13:17.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那言归正传
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:19.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这与君山附近
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.10,0:13:20.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有一个传说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.60,0:13:22.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说山里住着一个诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.73,0:13:23.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,面貌丑陋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.77,0:13:24.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,行踪诡异
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.07,0:13:26.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,专抢出嫁的新娘
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.57,0:13:28.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,过去近百年间
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.15,0:13:30.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,已有十七名新娘失踪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.99,0:13:32.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,上百名送亲人遇难
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:35.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这事原本传不到天上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.20,0:13:37.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但恰恰第十七位新娘
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:39.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,父亲是个官老爷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.12,0:13:41.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,当初风闻此地传说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:44.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,精心挑选了四十名勇武绝伦的随侍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.05,0:13:46.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,护送爱女成亲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.67,0:13:48.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,偏偏女儿还是没了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.63,0:13:49.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那官老爷爱女如命
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.34,0:13:51.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,暴怒之下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.47,0:13:52.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,联合一众官朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.18,0:13:54.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,倾尽全力祈福请愿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.35,0:13:56.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还重金悬赏诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.27,0:13:58.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,搞得整个北方不得安宁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.35,0:14:01.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这才惊动了上边的神官
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:03.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们此次的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.81,0:14:05.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,便是抓到这诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.82,0:14:07.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,失踪新娘可有共同之处
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.90,0:14:11.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有穷有富 有美有丑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.45,0:14:12.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有妻有妾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.07,0:14:14.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一言蔽之
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:14.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,毫无规律
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.16,0:14:17.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有谁见过这诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.33,0:14:18.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,并无
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.96,0:14:22.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,既无人见过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.17,0:14:23.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你又怎知是诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:24.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是别的什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:26.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诡新郎只是一个叫法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.84,0:14:28.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过你说的有理
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.01,0:14:29.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天色不早了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.26,0:14:32.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,先找个落脚地再讨论吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.89,0:14:39.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.35,0:14:45.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还有人不怕死
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.77,0:14:46.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,敢来送亲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.45,0:15:01.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这些人不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.25,0:15:02.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.79,0:15:03.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.25,0:15:05.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.63,0:15:06.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.30,0:15:08.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.42,0:15:12.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,姑娘 他们只想用你引出诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:14.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你莫要被骗了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.51,0:15:15.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.85,0:15:21.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是个假的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.43,0:15:23.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.39,0:15:25.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好啊 又是你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.60,0:15:26.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你这臭婆娘
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.98,0:15:28.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,总坏老子好事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.65,0:15:31.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要是你肯扮新娘
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.07,0:15:34.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,老子也不会弄块儿木头作饵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:35.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好丑的丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.37,0:15:38.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,扶摇 不能这样说女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.16,0:15:40.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那不是小彭头和小萤姑娘吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.83,0:15:41.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还真是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.66,0:15:42.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这个小彭头
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:44.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,成天带着一群泼皮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.58,0:15:45.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,整些歪门邪道的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.38,0:15:48.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,最近又盯上官老爷的悬赏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.17,0:15:49.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要抓什么诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.05,0:15:51.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你 你们别听他的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:53.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,与君山那么危险
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:53.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.55,0:15:56.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他 他只是想要赏金
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.09,0:15:56.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,拿点钱怎么了\N他 他只是想要赏金
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.55,0:15:57.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,拿点钱怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.55,0:16:00.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家伙儿不也顺道为民除害了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.89,0:16:02.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可不 这钱还少了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.06,0:16:04.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但 但这不是在送死吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.19,0:16:06.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,之前让你假扮新娘子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.73,0:16:07.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不肯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.52,0:16:09.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,现在我们要去抓人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.06,0:16:09.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你又来拦路
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.27,0:16:11.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你到底什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.36,0:16:12.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是 你说呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.73,0:16:14.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这么不想让人去呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:16.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,敢情那诡新郎是你相好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.11,0:16:17.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你胡说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.66,0:16:19.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你隔三差五就往与君山里跑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.99,0:16:21.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大伙都看到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.79,0:16:22.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.87,0:16:23.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,老实交代
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:24.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你的相好在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.91,0:16:25.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.33,0:16:28.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你 你们别过来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.51,0:16:37.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,欺人太甚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.97,0:16:41.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,听说这诡新郎满脸绷带
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.97,0:16:42.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,奇丑无比
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.97,0:16:44.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,跟你还
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.44,0:16:54.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你 你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.03,0:16:57.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.36,0:16:59.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这人使妖法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.61,0:17:00.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,给我上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.59,0:17:18.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:19.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,来呀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.63,0:17:20.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不打了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.39,0:17:21.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,今天算你赢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.68,0:17:23.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你别得意 咱们走着瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.31,0:17:32.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,柱子记得赔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:33.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.15,0:17:37.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,姑娘 可有受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.95,0:17:43.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你 你要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.54,0:17:47.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,姑娘 你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.87,0:17:48.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,流氓
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.25,0:17:53.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你裙子破了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.67,0:17:59.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以以后少管闲事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.93,0:18:01.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,主动帮忙还被倒打一耙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:02.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,全天下也只有你了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.18,0:18:04.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,行 帐清了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.51,0:18:05.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:08.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谢谢掌柜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.18,0:18:09.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.06,0:18:11.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知离这最近的明光庙怎么走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:13.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明光庙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.65,0:18:15.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们这儿没有明光庙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.69,0:18:17.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.03,0:18:18.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.49,0:18:20.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.53,0:18:21.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,倒有一间南阳庙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.95,0:18:24.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,离这儿五里地
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.66,0:18:26.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,出了城右转就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.59,0:18:39.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.51,0:18:41.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,北方明明是明光将军的地盘
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.72,0:18:43.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,却竟然只有南阳庙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.06,0:18:48.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南阳真君主东南
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.68,0:18:50.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,在北方的香火竟也这般旺盛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.14,0:18:51.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.60,0:18:53.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不错不错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.77,0:18:54.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,深受爱戴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.52,0:18:56.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但我有个疑问
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.73,0:18:57.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.69,0:18:58.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知当讲不当讲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.78,0:18:59.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那就不要讲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.61,0:19:02.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其实我想说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:03.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知有谁能解答
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:07.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下是不是想问南阳庙的典故
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:08.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,典故
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.20,0:19:08.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.20,0:19:11.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,很久以前
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.58,0:19:14.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南阳将军曾叫俱阳将军
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.79,0:19:16.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可那时有个糊涂的国君
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.84,0:19:19.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,错把俱阳写成了臣阳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.26,0:19:22.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,全天下的俱阳庙都改了名
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:26.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就这么一传十十传百
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.85,0:19:29.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,错字早已修正
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.14,0:19:30.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有什么用呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.47,0:19:31.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,时至今日
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.85,0:19:34.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,来南阳庙的依然是女客居多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.81,0:19:36.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还一个个含羞带怯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.65,0:19:37.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小脸通红
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:38.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,少阴阳怪气
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.23,0:19:40.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,闲得慌就扫地去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.53,0:19:43.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.61,0:19:44.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.57,0:19:47.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,当年你家将军不就是给太子殿下端茶送水
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.66,0:19:48.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,扫地铺床的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.74,0:19:49.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,听你这话说的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.49,0:19:53.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还以为南阳殿多为太子殿下打抱不平呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.08,0:19:55.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你家将军倒确实忘恩负义
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.17,0:19:57.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子当年飞升
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:19:57.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还点了他的将
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.38,0:19:59.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,结果太子被贬
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:01.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他立刻过河拆桥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.17,0:20:02.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还不许人提这段丑事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.01,0:20:05.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你家将军也不过五十步笑百步
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.34,0:20:07.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说是太子侍卫 忠心耿耿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.43,0:20:09.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,最后还不是背信弃义 抛弃主人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.51,0:20:12.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:26.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.32,0:20:29.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,落灰了还吃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.66,0:20:31.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,停下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.29,0:20:34.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,第一
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.00,0:20:37.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们口中的太子殿下 正是本人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.38,0:20:39.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我都没说话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.79,0:20:41.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们就不要把我当刀使
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.38,0:20:42.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,第二
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:44.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,既然你们来协助我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.88,0:20:46.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那我们到底谁听谁的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.68,0:20:48.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,听你的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.59,0:20:50.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.35,0:20:52.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那我们来办正事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.64,0:20:53.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谁借我点法力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.97,0:20:54.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我要联系灵文
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.31,0:20:57.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你自己的法力呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.40,0:20:59.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我的不够
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.07,0:21:10.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.82,0:21:12.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,北方可还顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.03,0:21:15.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,两位小神官的助力如何
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.87,0:21:17.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还好 各有千秋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.12,0:21:19.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都是可塑之才
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.29,0:21:20.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.63,0:21:22.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,北方是裴将军坐镇之地
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.59,0:21:23.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,香火很旺
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.92,0:21:25.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若是有需要
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.30,0:21:26.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可在他的明光殿落脚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.34,0:21:28.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们并未找到明光殿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.18,0:21:30.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,便在一间南阳庙歇下了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:32.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没有明光殿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.55,0:21:33.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这倒是奇了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.76,0:21:34.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,关于诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.22,0:21:36.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还有更多情报吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:38.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.89,0:21:40.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诡新郎的评级出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.27,0:21:45.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,位于恶 厉 凶 绝中的第三等
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.15,0:21:47.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仅次于绝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.03,0:21:49.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若放任下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.49,0:21:50.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,必定危害重大
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.07,0:21:52.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,伏尸千里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.28,0:21:56.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还请殿下速战速决
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:01.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这么久才出个评级
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.79,0:22:03.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,灵文殿效率也太低了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.17,0:22:05.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诡新郎是凶
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.67,0:22:06.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,危害不容小觑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.63,0:22:08.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们要尽快解决
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.67,0:22:10.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们有什么想法
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.97,0:22:13.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,诡新郎既然对新娘子有兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.35,0:22:15.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那便用新娘引他出来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.35,0:22:18.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可假人和障眼法对凶行不通
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.73,0:22:19.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还是得用活人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.35,0:22:22.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,并非所有的新娘都会失踪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.60,0:22:23.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,应该还有别的条件
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.23,0:22:25.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,管他的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.48,0:22:27.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,找个女子来做诱饵
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.82,0:22:28.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,试了再说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.78,0:22:29.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.61,0:22:30.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,万一失手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.78,0:22:32.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一个弱女子就是死路一条
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.36,0:22:32.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.86,0:22:33.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不能找女子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.20,0:22:35.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你还想找男人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.58,0:22:37.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,上哪儿找个男人愿意扮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.60,0:23:03.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如果我是诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.23,0:23:05.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谁要送这种女人给我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.06,0:23:07.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你就灭了那个镇子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.61,0:23:09.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我就杀了这个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.44,0:23:11.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那只能说幸好我不是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.74,0:23:13.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,公 公子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.70,0:23:16.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.45,0:23:18.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是昨天那个
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.70,0:23:21.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不不 你不要误会
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.75,0:23:23.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我 我没有这种爱好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.87,0:23:25.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只是为了引出诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.63,0:23:26.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.04,0:23:28.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,公子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.84,0:23:30.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,昨天真抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.05,0:23:31.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我误会你了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:32.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,听茶摊掌柜说
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.26,0:23:33.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们在这儿歇脚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.47,0:23:34.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我就带了些吃的来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.93,0:23:36.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.26,0:23:37.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,举手之劳
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.18,0:23:38.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,姑娘不必在意
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.43,0:23:40.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,公子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.47,0:23:42.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我会改衣服也会梳妆打扮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.44,0:23:45.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要不 我来帮你扮新娘子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.60,0:23:47.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.12,0:23:59.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,情况如何
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.95,0:24:01.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,轿夫花重金聘了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.83,0:24:02.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,而且都是当地人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.08,0:24:03.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,会些功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.96,0:24:04.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,熟悉道路
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.17,0:24:05.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,能自保
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.92,0:24:08.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下还是多关心自己
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.30,0:24:12.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他们果然是来抢悬赏的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.17,0:24:14.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小萤这丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.47,0:24:15.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,自己人不帮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.59,0:24:16.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,偏偏胳膊肘往外拐
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.18,0:24:17.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对吧 小彭
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.51,0:24:18.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.51,0:24:21.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,螳螂捕蝉 黄雀在后
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.85,0:24:22.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看谁斗得过谁
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.81,0:24:25.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走 跟上
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.02,0:24:25.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.53,0:24:34.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小姐 高龄出阁
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.20,0:24:36.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,感受如何呀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.16,0:24:38.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,甚感遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.49,0:24:40.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这送亲队伍里少了很重要的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.33,0:24:42.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,应该都备齐了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.49,0:24:43.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还少什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.58,0:24:46.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,两个陪嫁丫鬟
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.42,0:24:48.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.12,0:24:49.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你就当家中贫穷
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.83,0:24:50.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没钱买丫鬟
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.09,0:24:52.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.25,0:24:54.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,话说 我们到哪儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.42,0:24:56.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,进与君山好一会儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.47,0:25:04.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.56,0:25:06.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嘘
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.35,0:25:08.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们有听见笑声吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.27,0:25:11.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我没听见任何声音
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.44,0:25:13.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.82,0:25:17.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,故意只让我一个人听见
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.82,0:25:21.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好 好像有点儿不对劲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.99,0:25:23.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别停 当作无事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.54,0:25:29.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,它在唱歌
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.92,0:25:30.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,唱的什么
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.58,0:25:32.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,泪汪汪
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.84,0:25:33.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,过山岗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.30,0:25:35.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,盖头下
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.30,0:25:36.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,莫把笑扬
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.51,0:25:37.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.84,0:25:38.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,警告你不要笑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.34,0:25:40.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也可能是圈套
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.01,0:25:42.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,或许哭了才会出事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.89,0:25:45.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不管我是哭是笑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.47,0:25:46.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,最坏的结果是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.77,0:25:48.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,被劫走
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.56,0:25:50.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.94,0:25:52.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有一件事我得告诉你们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.19,0:25:53.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.23,0:25:56.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,从上轿起
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.86,0:25:58.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我就在笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.16,0:26:11.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,狼 是狼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.54,0:26:12.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,与君山怎么会有狼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.27,0:26:28.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看来是个法阵
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.68,0:26:29.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,得找到阵眼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.52,0:26:31.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南风 扶摇
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.60,0:26:32.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们那边顶得住吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.60,0:26:33.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一群畜生
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.73,0:26:34.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不在话下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.95,0:26:44.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.66,0:26:46.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.49,0:26:48.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你别出来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.67,0:26:54.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是鄙奴
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.04,0:26:55.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我最恨这东西
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.34,0:26:57.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,打起来没完没了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.42,0:26:59.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,被它耗光体力
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.63,0:27:00.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们就玩完了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.09,0:27:06.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,灵文殿没说有这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.97,0:27:10.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,完全没提
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.85,0:27:13.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,来了多少只
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.94,0:27:18.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一百多只
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.98,0:27:19.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可能更多
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.44,0:27:21.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,超过十只就很棘手了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.32,0:27:23.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一百多
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.82,0:27:25.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再耗下去就麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.99,0:27:28.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.79,0:27:30.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,绞杀
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.59,0:27:47.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不是没有法力
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.76,0:27:48.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,用不了法宝吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.76,0:27:50.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,凡事总有例外
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.77,0:27:53.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们先走
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.64,0:27:54.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.52,0:27:55.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们围着轿子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.60,0:27:56.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就一直会有东西过来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.11,0:27:57.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,打不完的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.27,0:27:58.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,先带人走
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.65,0:28:00.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.53,0:28:01.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我留下来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.40,0:28:02.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,会会那诡新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.36,0:28:04.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有空拉拉扯扯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.82,0:28:05.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不如先安顿了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.07,0:28:06.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再回来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.70,0:28:11.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这边 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.31,0:29:16.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.78,0:29:34.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,中原有古国仙乐
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.20,0:29:36.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙乐有太子谢怜
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.75,0:29:41.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子心怀苍生 一心修行
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.83,0:29:42.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其美谈
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.50,0:29:45.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,在民间广为流传
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.47,0:29:49.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,神武大街惊鸿一瞥
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.52,0:30:04.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,救坠楼小儿于万民之前
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.66,0:30:19.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一念桥头激然一剑
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.16,0:30:21.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,斩厉鬼于三问之间
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.04,0:31:07.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天帝感曰
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.63,0:31:09.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,此子前途无量非凡
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.63,0:31:12.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子年少飞升
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.55,0:31:13.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,位列仙班
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.75,0:31:44.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,然好景不长
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.33,0:31:46.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙乐国难
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.29,0:31:48.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子私自下凡救国无果
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.04,0:31:49.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,堂堂花冠武神\N太子私自下凡救国无果
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.30,0:31:49.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子私自下凡救国无果
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.67,0:31:50.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如今在人间拾荒为生
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.25,0:31:51.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,遭贬凡间\N如今在人间拾荒为生
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.34,0:31:51.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,遭贬凡间
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.26,0:31:54.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要我说 风信慕情走得好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.97,0:31:55.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,感情深有什么用
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.51,0:31:56.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,神官之耻 三界笑柄\N感情深有什么用
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.43,0:31:57.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没前途啊\N神官之耻 三界笑柄
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.60,0:31:57.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,神官之耻 三界笑柄
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.76,0:31:57.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,之后谢怜又飞升 还不是一炷香就下去了\N神官之耻 三界笑柄
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.89,0:32:01.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,之后谢怜又飞升 还不是一炷香就下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.31,0:32:47.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如果不知为何而活
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.56,0:32:49.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那就为我活下去吧
